@Ordering_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Mutlu yol: 1 klavye (750) → birkaç saniye içinde Confirmed
POST {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [ { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Ödeme reddi + compensation: 2 monitör (13000 > 10000) → Rejected, stok geri bırakılır
POST {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [ { "productId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Stok yetersiz: 100 klavye → Rejected
POST {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [ { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 100 } ] }

### Bilinmeyen ürün → 400
POST {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [ { "productId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Liste
GET {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders

### Tek sipariş
GET {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Saga durumu (AwaitingStock / AwaitingPayment / Completed / Failed)
GET {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders/{{orderId}}/saga

### Kargola (sadece Confirmed)
POST {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

### İptal (Shipped ise 409; Confirmed ise 204 + OrderCancelled → Inventory stoğu iade eder)
POST {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Sağlık
GET {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/health
